{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fractured Library Demo is set in the same world as the main game, but tells a mini-story that will allow you to experience the world, gameplay, and vibe without spoiling the full release.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984930/extras/e3848f3d80e1e002385d2254b49c4d7f.avif?t=1756541526\" data-has-big width=1560 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Fractured Library Demo, you play as Kayak, who is assisting Hazel the witch with the Library clean-up after a long period of rain.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Kayak is sent to the north portion of Inkthistle forest to retrieve a special ingredient for an anti-weeding potion, she discovers an old friend of Hazel's lost and confused.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a magical mishap, Kayak must journey through a parallel world to help find the pages to a missing book, and in the process restore this man's memories.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984930/extras/6f839563e41b78168751ddfbe81114c0.poster.avif?t=1756541526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984930/extras/6f839563e41b78168751ddfbe81114c0.webm?t=1756541526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984930/extras/6f839563e41b78168751ddfbe81114c0.mp4?t=1756541526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984930/extras/c9b4dba625d87c3531ad31d1c83712d7.avif?t=1756541526\" data-has-big width=1560 height=388 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fractured Library is a narrative, exploration-based game without the stress of combat, level grinding, or jump scares.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It tells a story through light quest mechanics and interacting with the world around you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984930/extras/0cddc13e87ed25334d364deb553c49b3.poster.avif?t=1756541526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984930/extras/0cddc13e87ed25334d364deb553c49b3.webm?t=1756541526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984930/extras/0cddc13e87ed25334d364deb553c49b3.mp4?t=1756541526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984930?t=1756541526","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984930/8fd373b0263ed159914251ec87b3ad3aa0f6ac9d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756541526","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984930/fa1a5ccf60bd623aaa4f32376e76dcd4c08b15c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756541526","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984930/fa1a5ccf60bd623aaa4f32376e76dcd4c08b15c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756541526","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null